         "why": "*Next Friday* is a plan. A plan needs *am / is / are* + *going to* + verb. With *my coworker and I* (= we), the little word is *are*.",
         "whyFr": "*Next Friday* = un projet. Il faut *am / is / are* + *going to* + verbe. Avec « my coworker and I » (= nous), le petit mot est *are*.",
