         "k": "pick",
         "s": "The customer [[is sitting|is siting|is sitings|sits]] in the waiting room.",
         "why": "Short words like *sit* double the last letter before *-ing*: sit → si**tt**ing. *Right now* needs *is* + *-ing*.",
         "whyFr": "Les mots courts comme *sit* doublent la dernière lettre avant *-ing* : si**tt**ing. En ce moment = *is* + *-ing*."
