       "en": "The traps: “I **work** now” (habit form), “I **working**” (no *am*), “I’m **work**” (no *-ing*). And a few words almost never take *-ing*: **want, need, like, love, know, understand**. Say “I **want** a coffee”, not “I’m wanting”.",
