       "en": "No *do* when the sentence already has **am/is/are** or **can/will/should**: just put that word first. **Are you tired?** **Is it far?** **Can I try this on?** Never “Do you are…?” or “Do you can…?”.",
       "fr": "Pas de *do* quand la phrase a déjà **am/is/are** ou **can/will/should** : on met juste ce mot en premier. **Are you tired?** **Is it far?** **Can I try this on?** Jamais « Do you are… ? » ni « Do you can… ? ».",
