         "why": "*Doesn’t* already carries the **-s**, so the verb goes back to simple: *drive*.",
         "whyFr": "*Doesn’t* porte déjà le **-s**, donc le verbe redevient simple : *drive*.",
         "hint": "Two words are carrying an -s."
